  "description": "Celebrate love and creativity with this charming Pink Heart Stripes Seamless Pattern Bundle, featuring six beautifully hand-painted watercolor-inspired seamless repeating designs. Combining soft blush pink stripes, playful hearts, and elegant vertical and wavy line patterns, this digital paper collection creates a sweet and romantic aesthetic perfect for Valentine’s Day and everyday love-themed projects.\nThese seamless digital papers are ideal for fabric printing, scrapbooking, junk journals, sublimation, wrapping paper, stationery, greeting cards, invitations, planners, stickers, wallpaper, POD products, and countless DIY craft projects. Each design is carefully created for flawless repeating, delivering professional-quality results for both print and digital applications.\nWhether you’re designing romantic gifts, feminine branding, nursery décor, apparel, party decorations, or printable crafts, these watercolor heart stripe patterns add a soft, modern, and elegant touch to every creative project.\nYou Will Receive\n➤ 20 Individual JPG Files\n➤ 12″ x 12″ Inches\n➤ 300 DPI High Resolution\n➤ Seamless Repeat Patterns\n➤ Instant Digital Download\nFeatures\n➤ Hand-painted watercolor heart stripe designs\n➤ Soft pink and blush romantic color palette\n➤ Seamless repeating digital paper collection\n➤ Perfect for fabric, scrapbooking, sublimation, wrapping paper, stationery, invitations, planners, stickers, wallpaper, POD products, and digital crafts\n➤ High-resolution 300 DPI quality\n➤ Instant digital download",
